'''Hard mode''' changes the gameplay compared to Normal in some ways to make it more difficult.
When playing in Hard mode, a small red pentagram ({{mode|hard}}) appears on the [[HUD]], below the [[HUD#Pickups|pickups]].

== Differences ==
* 2-3 more [[rooms]] generate each floor.
* {{dlc|nr}} Standard rooms with a difficulty of "1" cannot generate.
** {{dlc|r}} Standard rooms with a difficulty of "1" have a reduced chance of appearing.
** Most rooms with this difficulty are very easy, making difficult rooms more common.
* {{dlc|a+}} Rooms with a difficulty of "15" are able to generate on the second floor of chapters 1-4.
** {{dlc|r}} Additionally, they can always spawn on single floor chapters.
* {{dlc|nr}} Enemies have a base 20% chance to become [[Champion]]s instead of only 5%.
* Champion enemies only award [[pickup]]s 33% of the time instead of 100%.
* {{dlc|nr}} 66% of [[Heart]] drops from completing rooms are removed and replaced with nothing.
** {{dlc|r}} 34% of [[Heart]] drops from completing rooms are removed and replaced with nothing.
* {{dlc|nr}} Only champion [[boss]]es will drop hearts; normal bosses will not.
* Floors are more likely to have [[curse]]s.
* {{m|Slot Machine}}s are half as likely to pay out.
* {{m|Fortune Telling Machine}}s have an 85% chance to give a fortune, instead of 65%.
* {{m|Confessional}}s only have a 25% chance to pay out, instead of 30%.
* {{m|Blood Donation Machine}}s only give out one coin per use.
** {{dlc|r}} Also applies to {{i|IV Bag}}.
* {{m|Beggar}}s require a minimum of 6 donations before paying out.
** {{dlc+|r}} This doesn't apply to {{m|Bomb Bum}}s or {{m|Key Master}}s.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} The {{r|Shop}} has a 50% chance of becoming a lower level, regardless of having store upgrades unlocked.
* {{dlc|r}} The drop rate of {{e|Soul Heart}}s from {{e|Blue Fire Place}}s and {{e|Purple Fire Place}}s is decreased to 10%, instead of 25%.
* {{dlc|r}} The drop rate of {{e|Double Heart}}s is decreased to 2%, instead of 5%.
* {{dlc|r}} The chance of a {{e|Micro Battery|n}} spawning in place of other types of [[Batteries]] is increased to 83.33%, instead of 66.67%.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Rocks|Tinted rocks]] have a 50% lower chance of appearing.
* {{dlc|r}} Certain enemies and bosses have increased shot and movement speed.
** [[The Harbingers]] have increased charge attack speeds where applicable.
* {{I|Dogma}} does not provide the effect of {{I|The Wafer}}.

