== Trivia ==
* Before update 1.03, the reduced drop-rate affected all [[pickup]]s (not just Red Hearts).
* Most Hard mode unlocks are [[co-op]] babies, with the notable exceptions of {{i|Godhead}}, {{i|Smelter}}, {{i|Marrow}}, {{i|Mega Mush}}, {{i|Death Certificate}} and the character {{c|Bethany}}.
* {{i|Godhead}}'s unlock requirements were extended in later DLCs due to the addition of more [[completion mark]]s, but it can still be unlocked in the base game using the same method.
* {{dlc|r}} The Repentance chances for max level shops and tinted rocks were initially much more sparse. These chances were increased in update [[v1.06.J791]] a few days later.
* {{dlc+|r}} None of the tainted characters have unlocks tied to getting all completion marks, apart from {{i|Death Certificate}}.{{dlc-}}

